    "sourceUrl" : "",
    "body" : "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" data-updated-on=\"1730792514778\" id=\"item-6729c92bcc145756c78cfb90\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-0d05987fb06eaa9cfdb4\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>About us: </strong>PropertyMedia Japan specializes in Real Estate Photography, Videography, Aerial Photography, Floorplans and Virtual Staging. Previously based in Queenstown New Zealand, we are now operating in Niseko, Hokkaido Japan.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Bedrooms: </strong>A well-appointed bedrooms create a serene retreat for the whole family.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Kitchens:</strong> Enjoy culinary adventures in the modern kitchen, designed for efficiency and style.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Living Spaces:</strong> With 2 inviting living rooms, there\u2019s plenty of room for entertaining guests or enjoying family time.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Garage:</strong> The single-car garage ensures secure parking and additional storage.</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Located in a friendly neighborhood, 12 Tuangi Way is conveniently situated near local amenities, schools, and parks. Don\u2019t miss the chance to make this delightful home your own. </p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block gallery-block sqs-block-gallery\" data-block-json=\"&#123;&quot;existingGallery&quot;:null,&quot;hSiz